{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>日本免費摸貓網爆紅</h2>\n<p>日本有網民製作了一個「撫摸貓咪模擬器」（原名：猫撫でシミュレーター）Mini Game，讓貓奴隨時隨地都能「網上摸貓」，一解貓癮。遊戲上線後迅速在社交平台X引發熱議，不少網民直言「手感真實到完全停不下來」。\n</p>\n<h2>13款貓咪任你揀</h2>\n<p>玩家可以操控虛擬手掌盡情撫摸13種不同花色的貓咪。遊戲更提供日夜背景選擇，無論是清晨陽光還是夜晚燈光，都能營造出不同的摸貓氛圍。當手掌摸過貓背時，會即時呈現貓毛的光澤與身體反應，無論是摸頭、摸尾，還是順毛，讓人有如真的在摸貓一樣。遊戲最近更追加調校胖瘦、「煲水聲」等新功能。玩家可自由調整貓咪的體型，撫摸時更有貓咪滿足時發出的呼嚕聲，聽到便令人心情大好，治癒感十足。</p>\n<p>網站：<a href=\"https://pet-the-cat.pages.dev/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://pet-the-cat.pages.dev/</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568721527140489_5317416086b08032f997fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568721527140489_5317416086b08032f997fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568721719580913_5426626846b08033184b68.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568721719580913_5426626846b08033184b68.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgMoEBLCXYj/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:01.871270+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":424,"images":2,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:00:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:27.235125+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:20.760873+00:00","content_hash":"bf00b8cf5ca0d6b9b94aea3adc13119a8a315335f393215dc98a2225ef